erson","person_id":"cbr-p002836","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-047-kong:p009","chapter_id":"c-shiji-047-kong"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m009-0046","start":46,"end":48,"surface":"昭公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002836","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-047-kong:p009","chapter_id":"c-shiji-047-kong"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m009-0049","start":49,"end":51,"surface":"昭公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002836","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-047-kong:p009","chapter_id":"c-shiji-047-kong"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m009-0060","start":60,"end":62,"surface":"昭公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002836","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-047-kong:p009","chapter_id":"c-shiji-047-kong"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m011-0007","start":7,"end":10,"surface":"魯昭公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002836","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-047-kong:p011","chapter_id":"c-shiji-047-kong"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji047-014","person_id":"cbr-p002836","surfaces":["昭公","魯昭公"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-047-kong"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-047-kong:p008","quote":"魯昭公之二十年，而孔子蓋年三十矣。齊景公與晏嬰來適魯，景公問孔子曰：「昔秦穆公國小處辟，其霸何也？」對曰：「秦，國雖小，其志大；處雖辟，行中正。身舉五羖，爵之大夫，起纍紲之中，與語三日，授之以政。以此取之，雖王可也，其霸小矣。」景公說。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-047-kong:p009","quote":"孔子年三十五，而季平子與郈昭伯以鬬雞故得罪魯昭公，昭公率師擊平子，平子與孟氏、叔孫氏三家共攻昭公，昭公師敗，奔於齊，齊處昭公乾侯。其後頃之，魯亂。孔子適齊，為高昭子家臣，欲以通乎景公。與齊太師語樂，聞韶音，學之，三月不知肉味，齊人稱之。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-047-kong:p011","quote":"孔子年四十二，魯昭公卒於乾侯，定公立。定公立五年，夏，季平子卒，桓子嗣立。季桓子穿井得土缶，中若羊，問仲尼云「得狗」。仲尼曰：「以丘所聞，羊也。丘聞之，木石之怪夔、罔閬，水之怪龍、罔象，土之怪墳羊。」"}],"rationale":"限本篇明示名、字、對話自稱、世系及附贊局部對應；世系求與冉求分開，武不接漢武帝，今皇帝與高皇帝不補姓名。子路仲由明示同指另存，冉有冉求與秦繆秦穆仍待核；附贊不當獨立作者正文或獨立見證。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:p008","tex